[31m-# ---------------------------------------------------------------- AppImage ----[m
[31m-# linuxdeploy packs the binary with every library it links (the way Tauri's[m
[31m-# AppImages are built), and its GTK plugin wires up the input-method, pixbuf[m
[31m-# and gio modules. Two passes: deploy first, then add WebKit's helper[m
